bad port FETCH_ERROR_REQUEST ERR_BLOCKED_PORT: fetch does not connect to port 6000: browsers and node block it too
ftp FETCH_ERROR_REQUEST ERR_UNSUPPORTED_SCHEME: fetch cannot get ftp://example.com/: only http:, https: and data: work
no url FETCH_ERROR_REQUEST ERR_INVALID_URL: fetch cannot parse "not a url" as a URL
credentials FETCH_ERROR_REQUEST ERR_CREDENTIALS_IN_URL: the URL http://user:pw@localhost/ has a user name or a password; send them in the authorization header instead
no host FETCH_ERROR_NETWORK ENOTFOUND: could not find the address of no-such-host.invalid: no such name in DNS
data 200 hello world
base64 200 hi
get with body FETCH_ERROR_REQUEST ERR_BODY_WITH_GET: a GET request cannot have a body: use POST, or drop the body
bad method FETCH_ERROR_REQUEST ERR_INVALID_METHOD: fetch does not send TRACE requests
no duplex FETCH_ERROR_REQUEST ERR_DUPLEX_REQUIRED: a request whose body is a stream needs duplex: "half"
small body 200 10 bytes
large body 413 
large stream 413 
corrupt gzip BODY_ERROR_MALFORMED ERR_INVALID_COMPRESSION: the body is not valid gzip: incorrect header check
4 bytes true
BODY_ERROR_USED ERR_BODY_USED the body is already read: text(), json(), bytes(), formData() and body() read it once fix the code
html ERR_INVALID_JSON text/html <html><title>502 Bad Gateway</title></html>
bare ERR_NOT_A_FORM no content-type the body is not a form: it has no content-type
refused FETCH_ERROR_NETWORK ECONNREFUSED could not connect to 127.0.0.1:PORT: nothing listens on this port connect 127.0.0.1 true
